[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    130[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   the alphabet the conversion distinguishes — `' '`, `\n`, `\t`, `-`, `+`, `0`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    131[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `9`, `a`, `.`, `\0` — which pins the ordering of the whitespace skip, the sign
